# Stray vibrato dictionary root created when `nix develop` runs from the repo
# root (the shellHook's `mkdir -p dictionary/...` is CWD-relative). The real,
# intended cache lives in ab-validator/dictionary/ (see ab-validator/.gitignore);
# this anchors the root duplicate so it never shows as untracked churn.
/dictionary/
